	(text "Note:\n- A load switch is used to accommodate the peak system current during operation (6A),\n   while also limiting the inrush current to safe levels (<2,A).\n- The Switch is placed on the system/battter rail to allow for battery charging \n   while the system is turned off"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
